+// =============================================================================
+// PFDW V18A exact signed radix-4 Booth multiplier
+// "correction-row Booth" power experiment.
+//
+// Difference from V17:
+//   V17 generated negative partial products with wide unary negation:
+//       -(A << s), -(2A << s)
